<title>UK: GSI sets warrants on Boeing Swiss Certificate.</title>
<headline>GSI sets warrants on Boeing Swiss Certificate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has</p>
<p>issued six million American-style call warrants on Boeing Swiss</p>
<p>Certificates, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>One Boeing Swiss Certiicate is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    160 CHF		   PREMIUM	26.32 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.0 CHF		   GEARING	7.13 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.MAY.97-15.JAN.99   PAYDATE	26.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  142.50 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
